    <string name="about_title">Practice %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_what">A meditation timer and a habit tracker. What you log stays on the phone: the app has no internet permission.</string>
    <string name="about_sound">Bowl sound made for this app, GPL v3</string>
    <string name="about_feed_the_llamas">Feed the llamas</string>
    <string name="about_close">Close</string>
    <string name="licences_title">Licenses</string>
    <string name="licences_source_head">Source code</string>
    <string name="licences_no_text">%s needs no license text here.</string>
    <string name="licences_licence">Practice is free software: GPL-3.0-only, copyright wander wildwood. What it is built on keeps its own licenses, listed below.</string>
    <string name="licences_back">Back</string>
    <string name="about_no_browser_address">No browser is installed. The address is %1$s.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_head">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">This app collects nothing and sends nothing anywhere: it has no internet permission. Your habits, ticks, the log of sittings with any notes, and its settings stay in its own private storage on the phone; uninstalling removes them, and the app is not included in phone backups. Save a backup writes them as one file only where you choose, when you press it. Its permissions are for the bells and the breathing cues only: exact alarms so the bells ring on time, a foreground service and wake lock so they ring with the screen off, a notification while a sitting is under way, vibration to mark each breath when you choose that cue, and, only if you switch it on, Do Not Disturb access to set alarms only during a sitting. There are no ads, no analytics and no tracking.</string>
    <string name="about_terms_head">Terms</string>
    <string name="about_terms">This app is free software under the GNU General Public License v3. It comes with no warranty, to the extent the law allows. It is a timer and a diary, not therapy or medical advice, and not a substitute for care.</string>
